# Yukiko's Castle 5F (field 60 room 1, a placed map with FOUR WARPS, no generated floor) from the arrival at the start (3600, 21200) to the east door
# of Avenger Knight: the retail route (p4hook --walk-game from the savestate story-castle5f0420.p2s; the same commands run in the port).
# The field script's warps (area -> script -> destination, found by moving the player onto each area with p4hook --poke on the player matrix):
#   3400 corridor east end (8918..9090, 15219..15937)  warp_006f_01 -> (3603, 11297)   [the corridor loops back; the way on is north from there]
#   3403 (3207..4004, 10108..10294)                    warp_006f_04 -> (7902,  5995)
#   3402 (8897..9083,  5674..6339)                     warp_006f_03 -> (14388, 10291)
#   3401 (14029..14762, 11311..11477) behind gate 280a warp_006f_02 -> (10071, 15607)   [EAST of the corridor's gates: the way past the loop]
#   3404 (4444..5124, 17328..17451)                    warp_006f_start (does not move the player; the first corridor walk passes its edge)
#   37ff (8653..9290, 3222..4167) is the stairs up; the east door (obj 2808/280b at 14900, 12000) is the boss.
# From (10071, 15607) the way is wall-bound: east along z 15400, then to (14010, 14640), the gate 2809 at (14395, 13212) (it opens by touching), the door.
# Shadows roam the floor: the battle driver plays every fight (battleskip:on lets the walks wait through them).
timeout:6000
wait:60
timeout:60000
battle:first=cross,cross,cross;plan=cross,cross,cross;skip=0;delay=20
battleskip:on
plan:on
plan:off
walk:3750,20650,130
walk:3750,20350,130
walk:3750,20150,130
walk:3750,19850,130
walk:3850,19650,130
walk:3950,19350,130
